WEBVTT

00:03.570 --> 00:07.450
Oh, man!
This feels like a real adventure!

00:09.570 --> 00:12.210
I thought so at first...

00:12.870 --> 00:14.540
Just when will we reach the place?!

00:14.540 --> 00:16.990
We've been walking
in the mountains for three days!

00:16.990 --> 00:19.460
Come on, just a little bit more.
We're almost there.

00:19.460 --> 00:20.540
Really?

00:21.330 --> 00:23.880
Stay on your toes.

00:23.880 --> 00:26.170
If not, you'll fall off the cliff.

00:27.670 --> 00:29.260
Those bones are massive!

00:29.260 --> 00:31.680
Great Sage, what are those creatures?

00:32.850 --> 00:36.140
Probably monsters
from the Abyss King's era.

00:36.680 --> 00:40.900
A fierce battle once took place
in the Kaogamika Mountains.

00:40.900 --> 00:43.520
I never knew
monsters of this size existed!

00:43.520 --> 00:44.820
This is amazing!

00:44.820 --> 00:47.860
Why did she get so excited?

00:49.490 --> 00:51.360
Thanks for scouting ahead.

00:51.360 --> 00:53.940
Anything ahead of us?

00:53.940 --> 00:55.660
No signs of humans or monsters.

00:55.990 --> 00:58.510
Even if we get attacked,

00:58.510 --> 01:01.330
you can turn into a dragon
and finish them off easily.

01:01.710 --> 01:05.379
You know,
that technique is very exhausting.

01:05.379 --> 01:07.300
It requires a lot of mana

01:07.300 --> 01:10.380
and will sore my hips
and legs the next day.

01:10.380 --> 01:11.970
You get it, right?

01:11.970 --> 01:13.890
Y-Yeah.

01:13.890 --> 01:16.890
It's very tiring to use magic.

01:17.430 --> 01:19.270
Hold on, are they...

01:20.310 --> 01:21.270
Muscle brain!

01:21.520 --> 01:22.230
Incompetent!

01:22.560 --> 01:24.150
Basement dweller!

01:24.940 --> 01:26.860
I wish I could go home now...

01:27.320 --> 01:28.690
Now, now...

01:29.990 --> 01:33.320
There is a place not far ahead
where we can take a break.

01:33.320 --> 01:35.370
We'll spend the night there.

01:35.910 --> 01:38.410
All right.
Come on, youngsters!

01:38.410 --> 01:40.040
We can take a break pretty soon!

01:40.040 --> 01:42.080
Fine...

01:51.880 --> 01:55.080
Um, Gramps, you're the Great Sage, right?

01:55.550 --> 01:57.310
Can you be honest with me?

01:57.850 --> 02:00.870
Is there any meaning
to collecting the rings?

02:01.310 --> 02:03.190
Why do you ask?

02:03.770 --> 02:07.110
The empire is planning
to fight the Abyss King

02:07.110 --> 02:09.340
without the power of the rings.

02:09.979 --> 02:14.240
They eliminated almost all the monsters
that attacked Maasa.

02:15.870 --> 02:19.410
It all seems different
from what I had expected.

02:20.290 --> 02:22.190
A hero who saved the world...

02:22.790 --> 02:25.870
The legendary Ring King
who defeated the Abyss King...

02:26.350 --> 02:27.900
It sounds great on the surface,

02:28.380 --> 02:32.300
but people don't really
expect anything from me.

02:32.760 --> 02:34.810
You could be right.

02:34.810 --> 02:36.410
It's a big world.

02:36.840 --> 02:40.560
Different people live their lives
with different ideals.

02:41.060 --> 02:45.060
Not everyone shares the same hope.

02:45.520 --> 02:48.640
If the humans can defeat monsters
without any help,

02:48.640 --> 02:50.860
they can probably defeat
the Abyss King, too.

02:50.860 --> 02:53.320
It's perfectly reasonable
to think that way.

02:53.950 --> 02:54.900
Is that so?

02:56.360 --> 03:00.170
These rings are not as trusted
by the people as I thought.

03:01.040 --> 03:02.370
However,

03:02.370 --> 03:06.750
I've seen my fair share
of the world at this point.

03:06.750 --> 03:08.670
There were bits and pieces,

03:08.670 --> 03:12.630
but I've heard horrible stories
about the Abyss King,

03:12.630 --> 03:17.180
including the scars that have endured
since the mythic age.

03:17.640 --> 03:20.640
There is no telling
how powerful the Abyss King is.

03:20.640 --> 03:22.890
We've seen it ourselves.

03:22.890 --> 03:26.440
He uses terrifying powers
we can't undo with magic

03:26.440 --> 03:28.980
to control his knights and monsters.

03:28.980 --> 03:33.650
That power was only a small portion
that leaked from his imprisonment.

03:34.570 --> 03:38.810
The humans will stand no chance
against him without help.

03:38.810 --> 03:43.370
All the remaining records in this world
led me to that conclusion.

03:49.690 --> 03:51.090
Relax.

03:51.090 --> 03:54.460
If the Abyss King comes back to life
just as the legend says,

03:54.460 --> 03:57.210
so will the Ring King.

03:57.720 --> 04:00.760
Satou, you've collected four rings.

04:00.760 --> 04:04.270
The final one might present
itself to you later on.

04:07.560 --> 04:09.650
All right.
My turn to keep watch.

04:09.650 --> 04:11.020
Go and get some sleep.

04:11.020 --> 04:11.980
All right.

04:18.529 --> 04:20.839
How can I even call myself
the Great Sage?

04:21.529 --> 04:22.980
I'm a failure.

04:33.840 --> 04:41.220
TALES OF WEDDING RINGS

06:00.670 --> 06:03.210
This is the Kingdom of Earth, Idanokan.

06:03.680 --> 06:06.410
The fallen dwarven city.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.930
Everything is in ruin.

06:12.810 --> 06:17.150
They fended off
the Abyss King's army several times.

06:18.360 --> 06:22.950
But the final battle
seemed pretty brutal.

06:24.200 --> 06:27.400
Before they could even rebuild their city,

06:27.400 --> 06:30.310
the dwarves were gone.

06:32.160 --> 06:34.620
This place really seems empty.

06:36.130 --> 06:39.840
This silence is sending
chills down my spine.

06:40.130 --> 06:43.340
Really? I'm quite fond of it.

06:43.340 --> 06:45.260
It's great to have the place to myself.

06:45.260 --> 06:46.240
I'd love to live here.

06:47.250 --> 06:50.100
It'd be even better
if it were warmer.

06:50.930 --> 06:53.520
I'll wait here.

06:53.520 --> 06:56.440
You can go on and look
for the Ring of Earth yourself.

06:56.980 --> 07:00.230
What's wrong, Princess Saphir?
Already worn out?

07:00.230 --> 07:03.780
I hate wandering aimlessly.

07:03.780 --> 07:07.280
This place is not far
from the Abyss' domain.

07:07.280 --> 07:09.240
I won't help if you get in trouble.

07:09.240 --> 07:12.500
Well, then. Keep me out of trouble.

07:12.500 --> 07:15.040
It's a great honor.
Give it your best.

07:15.410 --> 07:18.370
You are unbelievable.

07:19.710 --> 07:21.500
I'll carry you on my back.

07:21.500 --> 07:22.710
Come on. Get up.

07:24.220 --> 07:25.170
Huh?

07:25.590 --> 07:27.930
Nope! I can walk on my own.

07:28.970 --> 07:32.030
There is no need to be concerned,
shy little girl.

07:32.030 --> 07:34.100
I'm not!

07:34.100 --> 07:35.570
Is that so?

07:40.980 --> 07:42.400
What is it?

07:43.360 --> 07:45.320
I think someone's here.

07:47.700 --> 07:51.870
Perhaps it is the loneliness of the ruins
that makes you feel that way.

07:52.580 --> 07:53.810
I see...

08:09.930 --> 08:13.390
This place looks very clean.

08:14.140 --> 08:16.770
This looks like a throne.

08:17.060 --> 08:19.300
The place was probably their palace.

08:22.770 --> 08:23.900
And this is...

08:24.230 --> 08:26.860
Gramps! There is a corpse here!

08:26.860 --> 08:29.200
Calm down, Satou.

08:29.200 --> 08:31.660
That is not the body of a dwarf.

08:31.660 --> 08:35.330
It's an automaton,
a relic of the mythic era.

08:35.630 --> 08:38.039
An automaton?

08:38.039 --> 08:39.580
Like a robot?

08:39.580 --> 08:41.250
Relax.

08:41.250 --> 08:43.500
It won't move without mana.

08:43.500 --> 08:45.300
This is nothing but a doll.

08:45.670 --> 08:48.510
The dwarven civilization
was based around automation

08:48.510 --> 08:51.710
and contraptions driven by mana.

08:52.390 --> 08:55.260
They dig into the earth
and forge metal parts.

08:55.260 --> 08:59.770
It was said that they would sacrifice
their lives just to be the best craftsmen.

09:00.190 --> 09:04.400
This is the evidence of their existence
and their technology.

09:05.650 --> 09:07.740
Back in the war during the mythical era,

09:07.740 --> 09:11.610
dwarves had already started using
automatons as weapons.

09:12.240 --> 09:17.330
The moving platform of Needakitta
is one of the very few remaining relics.

09:17.750 --> 09:21.830
I heard our ancestors got it
from the dwarves long ago.

09:22.330 --> 09:24.630
I had no idea

09:24.630 --> 09:26.250
how the vehicle was moved.

09:26.710 --> 09:29.380
They left us all kinds
of things to discover,

09:29.380 --> 09:32.890
but no one knows
what happened to them.

09:33.230 --> 09:36.760
It truly was a chaotic time.

09:38.600 --> 09:43.560
As I expected, there is nothing here
to help us locate the ring.

09:43.560 --> 09:46.230
Should we check
the underground tunnel?

09:46.770 --> 09:49.530
Underground?
Do we have to keep going?

09:55.700 --> 09:57.490
Perished...

09:57.910 --> 10:00.450
We perished...

10:01.000 --> 10:05.040
Everyone in the Kingdom of Earth...

10:20.600 --> 10:22.890
Gramps, what is going on here?

10:22.890 --> 10:25.980
Looks like things could
still be functional.

10:25.980 --> 10:27.520
But how?

10:27.520 --> 10:29.400
Wait, this is...

10:35.570 --> 10:37.700
The Knight of the Abyss King!

10:37.700 --> 10:39.830
He can control even machines?!

10:39.830 --> 10:41.330
He never ceases to surprise!

10:42.540 --> 10:43.880
Why?

10:44.370 --> 10:47.330
We fought on the same side.

10:47.330 --> 10:51.510
But why were we the ones who perished?

10:51.510 --> 10:56.840
Why did we have to die?

10:57.340 --> 10:58.800
What is it talking about?

10:59.260 --> 11:06.270
Wind, Fire, Water, and Light...
All of them shall perish!

11:06.980 --> 11:09.320
You will be sent to where we are,

11:09.320 --> 11:11.690
together with our lord!

11:11.690 --> 11:13.900
The Abyss will devour you!

11:16.820 --> 11:17.820
Oh, no!

11:21.620 --> 11:24.830
Satou is trapped on the other side.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.020
What is going on now?

11:35.760 --> 11:39.150
Don't get in my way,
boy from another world.

11:40.390 --> 11:43.640
The fate of this world
doesn't concern you.

11:43.640 --> 11:45.810
You have no reason to fight for it.

11:46.310 --> 11:47.600
No, you are wrong.

11:48.270 --> 11:52.150
I may not come from this world,
but this world...

11:52.650 --> 11:58.450
has people who live in peace
and all of Hime's loved ones.

11:59.700 --> 12:02.200
Are they worth risking your life for?

12:03.410 --> 12:04.500
Yes.

12:05.040 --> 12:08.000
I want to protect Hime's world.

12:08.870 --> 12:10.750
I will protect it!

12:17.090 --> 12:18.180
Satou!

12:27.310 --> 12:28.980
Thanks, Hime.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.670
You fool.

12:33.190 --> 12:35.990
You're just being used by this world!

12:55.670 --> 12:59.840
Do the dwarves hate us?

13:00.260 --> 13:01.970
Who knows.

13:01.970 --> 13:05.810
Maybe it said that under
the influence of the Abyss King.

13:14.610 --> 13:16.400
It's time.

13:17.940 --> 13:20.530
It's for the resurrection.

13:20.530 --> 13:23.870
The ancient king shall come back to life!

13:27.040 --> 13:28.500
What now?

13:29.290 --> 13:31.370
The black ring is vanishing.

13:32.920 --> 13:33.920
What?

13:35.170 --> 13:36.750
All the black rings...

13:37.590 --> 13:39.050
...are vanishing.

13:46.430 --> 13:47.640
Finally...

13:49.310 --> 13:50.640
It has begun.

14:07.660 --> 14:10.250
What is happening?

14:16.050 --> 14:17.670
Watch out! They're coming!

14:22.130 --> 14:23.840
Abyssal Creatures!

14:23.840 --> 14:27.600
It's dangerous to fight
without knowing what's going on!

14:27.600 --> 14:29.060
Let's get out of here!

14:35.350 --> 14:36.730
There are hordes of them.

14:37.230 --> 14:39.050
Where are they coming from?!

14:39.730 --> 14:42.360
Were they summoned here by someone?

14:42.360 --> 14:43.860
But there are too many of them.

14:43.860 --> 14:45.700
In that case...

14:45.700 --> 14:47.910
Miss! We need your help!

14:47.910 --> 14:49.120
My help?

14:49.120 --> 14:51.500
Turn into a dragon
and fend them off!

14:52.120 --> 14:53.950
No, I can't do it.

14:53.950 --> 14:55.960
The transformation
requires a lot of mana.

14:55.960 --> 14:58.920
I can't use it on a land
with so little water-element mana.

14:58.920 --> 14:59.850
Are you kidding me?!

15:03.720 --> 15:05.130
Satou.

15:05.130 --> 15:06.490
Get ready for combat.

15:16.560 --> 15:17.560
Satou! Behind you!

15:21.020 --> 15:22.820
I'll cover you.

15:23.240 --> 15:24.130
Thanks.

15:33.370 --> 15:36.540
Gramps, how did this happen?

15:37.210 --> 15:39.040
They just keep coming.

15:39.040 --> 15:42.500
There's no end to this.
I have no choice, but...

15:44.590 --> 15:46.300
Run! This way!

15:46.630 --> 15:49.140
We must get away now!

16:01.860 --> 16:03.030
Are you all right?

16:03.860 --> 16:05.150
Yeah.

16:05.150 --> 16:07.740
Just a bit exhausted.
All I need is a break.

16:09.740 --> 16:13.410
This is bad.
His stamina depletes too quickly.

16:13.410 --> 16:14.950
At this rate...

16:18.580 --> 16:22.420
Unbelievable...!

16:22.420 --> 16:24.630
There should have been more time.

16:25.550 --> 16:28.590
No. I should've known better.

16:29.300 --> 16:31.350
We are doomed!

16:32.180 --> 16:34.810
What... is going on now?

16:43.230 --> 16:48.490
The Abyss King has been fully resurrected!

16:56.500 --> 16:58.410
The number of monsters...

17:02.040 --> 17:06.880
Without all five rings, the Ring King
can't unleash his true power.

17:06.880 --> 17:09.589
Battling the monsters will be futile...

17:09.589 --> 17:12.640
Would the Ring King
collect all five rings first?

17:12.640 --> 17:15.430
Would the Abyss King
come back to life before that?

17:15.430 --> 17:20.990
If we lose on that gamble,
the rest of us and this world will...

17:30.200 --> 17:31.360
Satou...

17:33.280 --> 17:35.910
Our priority now is to flee.

17:35.910 --> 17:37.870
We have to find the Ring of Earth.

17:37.870 --> 17:41.080
There could still be time!

17:43.000 --> 17:46.250
He won't let us escape so easily.

17:46.250 --> 17:50.800
No. The Abyss King will hunt us down
to the edge of the world.

17:51.590 --> 17:54.720
He will find us.

17:55.430 --> 17:58.600
No! What should we do now?

17:58.600 --> 18:00.060
Don't worry.

18:00.060 --> 18:03.020
I won't let him take your lives.

18:08.150 --> 18:10.190
Gramps, what are you doing?

18:10.190 --> 18:12.030
Opening a portal.

18:12.030 --> 18:16.440
The Abyss King must never
get his hands on the rings.

18:17.830 --> 18:18.830
Gramps!

18:18.830 --> 18:19.830
Don't come here!

18:23.250 --> 18:25.170
I can take it from here.

18:27.340 --> 18:31.370
By closing the portal, there is no way
the Abyss King can pursue you.

18:32.390 --> 18:33.760
In order for you to escape,

18:33.760 --> 18:37.390
I must stay to close the portal.

18:37.390 --> 18:38.810
If it remained open,

18:38.810 --> 18:41.640
our plan could be ruined.

18:42.930 --> 18:47.230
Satou, you are my only hope.

18:47.230 --> 18:50.230
I'm sorry we have to
say our goodbyes this way.

18:50.230 --> 18:54.470
Please free the princesses
from their fate with the rings.

18:56.030 --> 18:58.580
Take care of Hime.

19:01.790 --> 19:02.870
No!

19:02.870 --> 19:04.500
Gramps!

19:08.290 --> 19:12.630
Are you sure you want to stay here?

19:12.630 --> 19:17.010
I've made up my mind
to defend this world until the very end.

19:17.010 --> 19:20.310
Sorry for dragging you into this mess.

19:20.810 --> 19:21.620
No.

19:22.140 --> 19:24.170
It's a great honor to fight by your side,

19:24.170 --> 19:25.390
Great Sage.

21:18.880 --> 21:20.090
That's right.

21:23.140 --> 21:24.540
I remember now.

21:29.060 --> 21:31.780
It must feel worse for the others.

21:39.360 --> 21:40.700
Gramps...

21:43.370 --> 21:45.410
Are we really back?

22:05.260 --> 22:07.150
T-This feels awful.

22:07.930 --> 22:10.350
It doesn't fit well.

22:10.350 --> 22:13.060
What is this thing?

22:13.060 --> 22:14.350
It's a bra.

22:14.350 --> 22:15.560
Try putting it on.

22:15.560 --> 22:16.820
Can I?

22:18.690 --> 22:21.240
I feel like I'm tied up.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.780
This is incredible.

22:23.240 --> 22:25.320
It kind of makes me nervous.

22:25.870 --> 22:28.660
Why would you wear something
so fancy under the clothes?

22:28.660 --> 22:30.410
Isn't it pointless?

22:30.410 --> 22:33.620
Your underwear is not meant
to be shown to others.

22:33.620 --> 22:36.170
But you do that all the time.

22:36.420 --> 22:41.130
Well... A little bit of that
can work quite well.

22:41.590 --> 22:43.970
The answer to that is pretty obvious.

22:44.380 --> 22:47.430
I get it now.
It's meant to seduce men.

22:47.760 --> 22:48.420
What...

22:59.610 --> 23:00.280
Hime?

23:07.660 --> 23:09.080
A bra?

23:17.710 --> 23:20.550
Hey, bring me the size that fits me.

23:20.550 --> 23:22.010
I don't have anything like that!

23:22.960 --> 23:25.180
This shirt smells funny.

23:25.180 --> 23:26.760
That belonged to Gramps!

23:27.300 --> 23:28.680
Princess Krystal!

23:28.680 --> 23:31.060
What is "free shipping?"

23:35.390 --> 23:38.670
Satou. G-Good morning.
